    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/8c3e8b1d92af6639eaa6e64f47e1dba4.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPDATE: 18 November 2024</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is deep in intense development, and I\u2019m pouring everything into making it an incredible, epic fantasy experience. Monsters, blood, weapons, spells, hot fairies and alot of GOLD is waiting for you. Your continued support means the world to me\u2014this is a massive project, and your encouragement truly keeps me going! Keep pushing me guys, and  wishlist the game...this is  so so important !!!!!!!!!!!!!! It takes still time, surly not as Duke Nukem ;)...but still a bit...Thank you all so much for being part of this journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>PLEASE WISHLIST, this is the only way to support CRUDE !</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4b9b918d7a6932ba4ad25f1986b210c9.poster.avif?t=1733751840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4b9b918d7a6932ba4ad25f1986b210c9.webm?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4b9b918d7a6932ba4ad25f1986b210c9.mp4?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You are KOSMOS, an MMA fighter from New York who suddenly has been teleported into a dark and mercyless fantasy world. You are trapped in a cruel world, and the only way to go back to your own world is to reach the towers of Doom, defeat the evil guardian of Crude and use his magic book to open a portal to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve quests, gather badass weapons, kill huge enemies and use magic items to survive in the universe of CRUDE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CRUDE is a soul-like, dark fantasy platformer. It contains metroidvania elements &amp; an open world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/e980e7c2b103541a3fd235fe0020cadc.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/ead066bb9525401215f9aeef1899d14a.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/0aa69f70c9805305a3c962109c82d913.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/97e6ab1ce1661a73b5efc019b71f51e2.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/84a21575e8bfa1aff87f606566df5b72.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/ded4ad00aa9b7e48d3a60ee56d4fd91d.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4ed7845dadf0759ce26f124c393066bf.poster.avif?t=1733751840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4ed7845dadf0759ce26f124c393066bf.webm?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4ed7845dadf0759ce26f124c393066bf.mp4?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Open world platformer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Many weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Special Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Partial destructible environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Magic spells</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/8c3e8b1d92af6639eaa6e64f47e1dba4.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPDATE: 18 November 2024</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is deep in intense development, and I\u2019m pouring everything into making it an incredible, epic fantasy experience. Monsters, blood, weapons, spells, hot fairies and alot of GOLD is waiting for you. Your continued support means the world to me\u2014this is a massive project, and your encouragement truly keeps me going! Keep pushing me guys, and  wishlist the game...this is  so so important !!!!!!!!!!!!!! It takes still time, surly not as Duke Nukem ;)...but still a bit...Thank you all so much for being part of this journey!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>PLEASE WISHLIST, this is the only way to support CRUDE !</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4b9b918d7a6932ba4ad25f1986b210c9.poster.avif?t=1733751840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4b9b918d7a6932ba4ad25f1986b210c9.webm?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4b9b918d7a6932ba4ad25f1986b210c9.mp4?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>You are KOSMOS, an MMA fighter from New York who suddenly has been teleported into a dark and mercyless fantasy world. You are trapped in a cruel world, and the only way to go back to your own world is to reach the towers of Doom, defeat the evil guardian of Crude and use his magic book to open a portal to return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve quests, gather badass weapons, kill huge enemies and use magic items to survive in the universe of CRUDE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CRUDE is a soul-like, dark fantasy platformer. It contains metroidvania elements &amp; an open world map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/e980e7c2b103541a3fd235fe0020cadc.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/ead066bb9525401215f9aeef1899d14a.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/0aa69f70c9805305a3c962109c82d913.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/97e6ab1ce1661a73b5efc019b71f51e2.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/84a21575e8bfa1aff87f606566df5b72.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/ded4ad00aa9b7e48d3a60ee56d4fd91d.avif?t=1733751840\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4ed7845dadf0759ce26f124c393066bf.poster.avif?t=1733751840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4ed7845dadf0759ce26f124c393066bf.webm?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446790/extras/4ed7845dadf0759ce26f124c393066bf.mp4?t=1733751840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Open world platformer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Many weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Special Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Partial destructible environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Magic spells</strong></p>",
